 rers” covering all of the lessons you slept through the first time around
 .\n\nWhether you were valedictorian\, prom queen\, a Model-UN nerd\, or all
  three because you peaked in high school (not judging!)\, this is the show 
 for you.\n\nAnd don’t worry\, we promise won’t assign a group project.\
